{% set chapters = collections.book | inFolder("category01") %}
<section id="category01" class="category{% if chapters[0].data.tocNested %} book-category{% endif %}">
  <h2 class="category-title">{{ chapters[0].data.categoryTitle }}</h2>
  <p>
  In this section you will find some pieces regarding embodiment through creative technology.
<br><br>
Baudrillard referred to Trompe l’Oeil* as a tactile promise that doesn’t follow through, drawing a comparison between this experience and that of death.
<br><br>
<i>So you are looking at a painting of a piece of paper and seeing its crease - yet being unable to reach out and crinkle it yourself.</i> How might technology come into play with this form of dissonance?
<br><br>
<i>So you are watching your hand through a VR set but it isn’t your hand at all. Is there freedom in it?</i>  
<br><br>
Following through on the promise of change, this section offers an examination of extending oneself and their somatic experience through multidisciplinary, multimedia experimentation and posthmanist shenanigans.
<br><br><br><br><br>
*Fooling of the eye – A renaissance genre of painting that preceded hyper-realism in contemporary fine art*
  </p>
  {% for chapter in chapters %}
  <article id="{{ chapter | fileId }}" class="chapter">
    {{ chapter.templateContent | safe }}
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
